{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24925","headline":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发 · 曹着","name":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渚亭临净域，凭望一开轩。\n晚日分初地，东风发杏园。\n异香飘九陌，丽色映千门。\n照灼瑶华散，葳蕤玉露繁。\n未教游妓折，乍听早莺喧。\n谁复争桃李，含芳自不言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}